    {
      "id": "section-693871622f6b1c2f9a033b6e",
      "kind": "chapter",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 3,
          "span": 8,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Context</h2>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6924bd2cc673e178e495efeb",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p>Wholesum is a qualitative-analysis platform built for researchers, analysts, and product teams who work with large volumes of text and need a faster, more structured way to extract insights. The tool integrates AI with a researcher-friendly workflow, enabling users to transform raw responses into organized themes, matrices, and client-ready reports.<br><br>The qualitative research space is growing rapidly, yet most existing tools fall into two extremes: overly technical enterprise systems or lightweight tools lacking depth. This gap presents a clear opportunity for a platform that combines <strong>speed, clarity, and analytical rigor</strong>—and that’s where Wholesum positions itself.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6924bf3ac673e178e4971b6b",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
