    {
      "id": "section-68f6a7c423f200144f715051",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 5,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>Problem</strong></h2><p>Researchers working with interviews, surveys, and open-ended responses <strong>struggle to organize and synthesize unstructured text</strong>. Existing tools are either too manual, too complex, or produce shallow AI summaries, making it hard to create reliable, client-ready insights and reports.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "start": 7,
          "span": 5,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>Solution</strong></h2><p>Wholesum provides an <strong>AI-powered yet researcher-controlled workspace</strong> that transforms raw text into themes, matrices, and executive summaries. The interface focuses on <strong>clarity, transparency, and editability</strong>, enabling analysts to move from data to insight much faster while keeping the depth and rigor of their work.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6920e5ca1b987551794cb00f",
      "kind": "chapter",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 3,
          "span": 8,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>Discovery</strong></h2>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6920ebfc1b98755179519c4f",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<p>In our initial discovery phase, we aligned with the founders to understand the strategic direction for Wholesum and reviewed <strong>user interviews, early prototypes, workflow notes, and product goals</strong>. This helped us clarify expectations, timelines, and success criteria before moving into design.<br><br>During this stage, challenges surfaced around the growing complexity of qualitative research workflows, inconsistencies in current tools, and the difficulty researchers face when working with large datasets. To dig deeper, we conducted follow-up conversations, audited real analysis artifacts, and gathered <strong>critical insights</strong>, including:</p><ul><li><p>Researchers rely heavily on manual coding, highlighting the need for structured yet flexible AI support.</p></li><li><p>Current tools feel overwhelming due to cluttered navigation and fragmented workflows.</p></li><li><p>Teams require transparent insight generation—not black-box summaries.</p></li><li><p>Analysts need exportable, presentation-ready results to support client work.</p></li></ul>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-69231462aeb8c159756464d0",
      "kind": "content",
