        {
          "start": 7,
          "span": 6,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>How it works</h2><p>Here are sample inputs and outputs that demonstrate the data format used throughout the pipeline. <br><br>For segmented plots, users can filter elements in <strong>out_theme_matrix.json</strong> by using columns from <strong>input_responses.json</strong>, such as location. Alternatively, out_theme_matrix.json may include relevant metadata alongside the theme allocations to make filtering and visualization easier.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6920ee121b98755179527d03",
      "kind": "chapter",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 3,
          "span": 8,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>Ideation</strong></h2>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-69230eb6aeb8c1597561a615",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>User Stories</h2><p>Using our discovery insights, I explored multiple directions for simplifying the analysis process. I began with user stories that captured the essential tasks researchers needed to accomplish, from uploading raw data to synthesizing themes and generating reports.</p><ul><li><p>As a researcher, I want to upload raw text data easily so I can begin analysis without friction.</p></li><li><p>As a researcher, I want AI-generated themes I can edit, merge, or reorganize to maintain accuracy.</p></li><li><p>As a researcher, I want a matrix view to compare themes across segments.</p></li><li><p>As a researcher, I want to generate summaries and exports that are client-ready.</p></li></ul>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-692380dbaeb8c15975935586",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Personas</h2><p>A clear snapshot of a typical user, capturing their motivations, behaviours, and challenges to guide product decisions and ensure every feature aligns with real needs.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
