    {
      "id": "section-6920f37d1b9875517953d002",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>User Flows</h2><p>We collaborated closely to create <strong>clear, linear user flows</strong> that reduce cognitive load and mirror how analysts naturally work. Our primary goal was to ensure each step felt intuitive: upload → process → explore → refine → export.</p><p>To improve clarity, we annotated complex steps, added decision points, and iterated flows based on early feedback. Throughout the project, we continuously refined the flows as feature requirements evolved.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
