    {
      "id": "section-6920f8611b98755179565b9d",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Style guide</h2><p>To ensure a consistent and polished user experience, I created a style guide that covers:</p><ul><li><p>Typography choices to maintain clarity across all screens</p></li><li><p>Accessible color tokens that are simple to use throughout the product</p></li><li><p>Input fields and comprehensive button styles, including clear visual states for normal, hover, active, and disabled interactions</p></li><li><p>A set of icons that support navigation and essential actions</p></li><li><p>A flexible component library featuring cards, tables, and panels</p></li></ul><p>This style guide provides a solid foundation for a cohesive interface and can easily grow as the product develops.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
