            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<p>For a smooth transition to development, I prepared a detailed handoff package with component specifications, spacing rules, interaction notes, and responsive behaviors. Specific focus areas included:</p><ul><li><p>Theme editing interactions</p></li><li><p>Matrix behavior and hover states</p></li><li><p>Summary builder logic</p></li><li><p>Export formatting and use cases</p></li></ul><p>I collaborated closely with engineering to clarify edge cases and ensure the design intent carried through to implementation. The clarity of the documentation significantly supported development efficiency.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6920f5251b98755179542507",
      "kind": "chapter",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 3,
          "span": 8,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>Reflection</strong></h2>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6921f6a2f178221721f37ca4",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 2,
          "span": 10,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<p>Working on Wholesum allowed me to rethink how qualitative research tools can better serve analysts. The project reinforced the importance of combining structured workflows with flexible editing and providing transparency throughout AI-generated insights.</p><p>I learned how crucial it is to design interfaces that reduce cognitive load—especially for users dealing with complex, text-heavy datasets. If given more time, I would explore additional collaboration features, further refine the export system, and deepen segmentation and comparison capabilities.<br></p><p>Overall, this project strengthened my approach to designing analytical tools and clarified how thoughtful UX can turn complex research processes into intuitive, efficient workflows.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
